(This template is for any Haas CNC machine.  EOL characters are not required.  If using another machine check controller documentation.)

(Startup Process)
M06 T1            
M03 S5000       
G54               
G00 G90 G17         
X0. Y0.            
G43 H01 Z0.15    
(END Startup Process)


(Set Feedrate)
G90 G01 F5. Z-0.15      (Go exactly 0.15 below the surface)

(Start the Letter D in Incremental)
G91                     (Switch to Incremental)
G01 Y1.0                (Draw the vertical back of the D)
G02 X0. Y-1.0 I0. J-0.5 (Clockwise arc back to the start)

(End Sequence)
G90                     (Absolute)
G00 Z2.                 (Retract safely to 2 inches above part)
G28                     (Home the machine)
M30                     (End program)
